<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA 94-2 AT LUNCH V SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 94-2 AT LUNCH V SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>India, chasing a victory target of 373, were 94 for two at lunch on the fifth and final day of the second and final test match against Sri Lanka in Colombo on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 332 (A.de Silva 146, D.Mohanty 4-78) and 415-7 declared (S.Jayasuriya 199, A.de Silva 120, A.Kumble 3-156), India 375 (S.Tendulkar 139, S.Ganguly 147) and 94-2 (A.Jadeja not out 56).</p>
